    "text": "By Ryan Smith Springfield Thunderbirds ,\n46 minutes ago SPRINGFIELD — The Springfield Thunderbirds (2-8-1-1) put forth a tenacious defensive effort and held off the Laval Rocket (8-5-0-0) for a 3-1 win on Wednesday morning inside a sold out MassMutual Center during the annual T-Birds School Day Game. A free-flowing and consistent first period effort from the T-Birds... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
